            <div className="mt-6 p-4 bg-white/10 rounded-xl border border-white/20">
              <p className="text-xs uppercase font-bold text-indigo-200 mb-1">Top Recommendation</p>
              <p className="text-sm italic">"A balanced diet tailored to {pet.breed} traits ensures long-term vitality."</p>
